flowchart TD
  accTitle: Runtime Feature Flags
  accDescr {
    NutsNews uses a small Supabase-backed runtime flag table to pause two documented behaviors without redeploying the Next.js app or Cloudflare Worker.
  }
  A[Client / service starts] --> B[Evaluate runtime feature flags]
  B --> C{Flag enabled?}
  C -->|Yes| D[Execute flagged behavior]
  C -->|No| E[Use default path]
  D --> F[Emit telemetry for rollout tracking]
  E --> F
  F --> G{Alertable risk?}
  G -->|Yes| H[Collect rollback and investigation cues]
  G -->|No| I[Continue normal operation]
  H --> I
